WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:03.016
Identify ways to keep the home and school orderly

00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:09.124
School rules: agreed expectations that protect learning and safety. Homework: a home

00:00:09.124 --> 00:00:11.176
task that helps practise skills.

00:00:12.033 --> 00:00:16.779
Attendance: coming to school consistently when able. School property: books, desks

00:00:16.779 --> 00:00:21.956
and facilities everyone must treat well. Inclusion: making every learner feel welcome

00:00:21.956 --> 00:00:23.681
and able to participate.

00:00:24.533 --> 00:00:27.648
Design a classroom rule chart with reasons for each rule.
